  <p class="qs-p">A gente gosta de boas conversas, processos simples, novas ferramentas e pessoas que têm vontade de criar.</p>
  <div class="qs-grade"><figure class="qs-card" style="--bg:#DCE7FD"><div class="qs-arte qs-arte-img"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Bruno Plaza" width="900" height="1125"></div><figcaption><b>Bruno Plaza</b><span>Sócio e diretor de criação</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="qs-card" style="--bg:#F1FBD0"><div class="qs-arte qs-arte-img"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Vinicius Buguas" width="900" height="1125"></div><figcaption><b>Vinicius Buguas</b><span>Sócio e diretor de conteúdo</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="qs-card" style="--bg:#F7E4DE"><div class="qs-arte qs-arte-img"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Thalys Melgaço" width="900" height="1125"></div><figcaption><b>Thalys Melgaço</b><span>Sócio e diretor de performance</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="qs-card" style="--bg:#DCE7FD"><div class="qs-arte qs-arte-img"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Rafael Valentin" width="900" height="1125"></div><figcaption><b>Rafael Valentin</b><span>Sócio e audiovisual</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="qs-card" style="--bg:#F1FBD0"><div class="qs-arte qs-arte-img"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Paula Zanetti" width="900" height="1125"></div><figcaption><b>Paula Zanetti</b><span>Atendimento</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="qs-card" style="--bg:#E3F3FC"><div class="qs-arte qs-arte-img"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Rafael Eda" width="900" height="1125"></div><figcaption><b>Rafael Eda</b><span>Desenvolvedor</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="qs-card" style="--bg:#EEE8FF"><div class="qs-arte qs-arte-img"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Sheila Silva" width="900" height="1125"></div><figcaption><b>Sheila Silva</b><span>Designer</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="qs-card" style="--bg:#F7E4DE"><div class="qs-arte qs-arte-img"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Juliana Ribeiro" width="900" height="1125"></div><figcaption><b>Juliana Ribeiro</b><span>Designer</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="qs-card" style="--bg:#DCE7FD"><div class="qs-arte qs-arte-img"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Guilherme Bazani" width="900" height="1125"></div><figcaption><b>Guilherme Bazani</b><span>Assistente de performance</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="qs-card" style="--bg:#EEE8FF"><div class="qs-arte qs-arte-img"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Jéssica Bazani" width="900" height="1125"></div><figcaption><b>Jéssica Bazani</b><span>Assistente de social media</span></figcaption></figure></div>
